 in the United S", "citation": "Gold hits seven-week high as weak US jobs data dents rate hike bets \u2014 Mint Markets, 2026-08-07. https://www.livemint.com/market/gold-hits-seven-week-high-as-weak-us-jobs-data-dents-rate-hike-bets-11786129243519.html"}, {"title": "Gold hits seven-week high as weak U.S. jobs data dents rate hike bets", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-07T15:55:36+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/news/gold-hits-seven-week-high-as-weak-u-s-jobs-data-dents-rate-hike-bets/articleshow/133037877.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Gold prices reached a seven-week high on Friday owing to surprising job losses in the United States that lowered the likelihood of upcoming rate hikes. This trend puts gold on track for its best weekly gain in seven months, as reduced interest rates boost its allure over yield-producing investments. Additionally, silver and platinum prices witnessed notable rises.\n\n(What's moving Sensex and Nifty Track latest market news, stock tips, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment strategies and stocks alerts, subscribe to our Telegram feeds .)\n\nSubscribe to ET Prime and", "citation": "Gold hits seven-week high as weak U.S. jobs data dents rate hike bets \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-07. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/commodities/news/gold-hits-seven-week-high-as-weak-u-s-jobs-data-dents-rate-hike-bets/articleshow/133037877.cms"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "comex_gold", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 GC=F", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GC=F"}, {"series": "comex_gold", "name": "CFTC Commitments of Traders", "url": "https://www.cftc.gov/MarketReports/CommitmentsofTraders/index.htm"}, {"series": "comex_silver", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 SI=F", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SI=F"}, {"series": "stoxx_50", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 ^STOXX50E", "ur